ts xii\nDomain Services • 161\nConditional Access • 161\nAuthentication • 162\nSign-in logs • 162\nAudit logs • 163\nRecommendations • 163\nHealth monitoring alerts • 164\nService level agreement • 164\nRisky users • 164\nApplication risk • 164\nEntitlement Management • 165\nAccess reviews • 165\nPrivileged Identity Management • 166\nLifecycle workflows • 166\nLicense usage • 167\nGlobal Secure Access • 167\nSecurity Copilot agents in Microsoft Entra ......................................................... 167\nConditional Access optimization agent • 169\nPrerequisites • 170\nLimitations • 171\nOnboarding the agent • 171\nAdjusting settings • 172\nReview suggestions • 174\nMicrosoft Entra Agent ID ................................................................................... 177\nSummary ......................................................................................................... 180\nExercises ........................................................................................................... 181\nAnswers ............................................................................................................ 181\nAdditional resources .......................................................................................... 182\nxiii Table of Contents\nPart 2: The Entra Governance Stack 183"],[75928,"Chapter 5: An Introduction to the International System of\nUnits (SI) – Conversion Factors for General Use (Unidirectional\nAlphabetical Conversion App Section) 79\n5.1 A Tab 80\n5.2 B Tab 82\n5.3 C Tab 86\n5.4 D Tab 89\n5.5 E Tab 92\n5.6 F Tab 93\n5.7 G-H Tab 95\n5.8 I-K Tab 98\n5.9 L-M Tab 101\n5.10 N-O Tab 103\n5.11 P-Po Tab 106\n5.12 Po-Pz Tab 108\n5.13 Q-R Tab 111\n5.14 S Tab 113\n5.15 T-Z Tab 115\nReferences 119\nAppendix A: Installation, Quick Start, and Use of the Enhanced\nUnit Converter MATLAB App 123\nAppendix B: App Details 125\nAppendix C: Conversion Examples 157\nAppendix D: Support Tabs and Help 161\nAppendix E: References 163